{%- comment -%}
  Shared fonts / color tokens / reset for the affiliate landing
  page sections affiliate-landing-hero, and the sections that will follow:
  why-different, short-list, reviews). Each of those sections renders
  this snippet once, so this <style> block prints once per section that
  includes it — a few duplicate KB of CSS across 4 sections is harmless
  and far simpler than trying to dedupe across sections, since Liquid
  variables don't persist from one section's render to another's.

  Custom properties are namespaced --wp-* on purpose, so they can't
  collide with any --primary / --accent tokens the main theme already
  defines elsewhere on the site.

  Assumes this page uses a blank ("layout: false") alternate page
  template with no theme header/footer — see the .wp-landing class
  below, which every section's root element should carry, so these
  resets stay scoped to this page even if that assumption changes later.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
@font-face{
  font-family:'Brandon Grotesque';
  src:url('https://www.porteandhall.com/cdn/shop/t/130/assets/BrandonGrotesque-Light.ttf?v=71162') format('truetype');
  font-weight:300; font-style:normal;
}
@font-face{
  font-family:'Brandon Grotesque';
  src:url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0084/8602/7327/files/BrandonGrotesque-Bold.woff?v=1753700643') format('woff');
  font-weight:700; font-style:normal;
}
@font-face{
  font-family:'Louize Display';
  src:url('https://www.porteandhall.com/cdn/shop/t/130/assets/LouizeDisplayTrial-Regular.woff?v=184402738702060371941754505253') format('woff');
  font-weight:400; font-style:normal;
}
:root{
  --wp-white:#FFFFFF;
  --wp-border:#E5E0D7;
  --wp-border-strong:#D9D4CB;
  --wp-text-body:#30383D;
  --wp-text-secondary:#6B6B6B;
  --wp-text-muted:#999999;
  --wp-tag-bg:#F3F0EC;
  --wp-primary:#546B82;
  --wp-primary-dark:#3E5266;
  --wp-accent:#896A28;
  --wp-accent-hover:#7A5A23;
  --wp-font-serif:'Louize Display', Georgia, serif;
  --wp-font-sans:'Brandon Grotesque', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
}
.wp-landing, .wp-landing *{box-sizing:border-box;}
.wp-landing{background:var(--wp-white);color:var(--wp-text-body);font-family:var(--wp-font-sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
.wp-landing a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
.wp-landing button{cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;font-family:inherit;}
.wp-landing img{display:block;max-width:100%;}
</style>
